# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in a real value.
#
# The Agent login and password-reset steps read OTP / reset emails
# from Gmail using the Gmail REST API. Provide a Google OAuth 2.0
# access token for the mailbox that receives the Agent emails
# (the base account behind the +tag address configured in data/testData.ts).
#
# Fastest way to get a token:
#   1. Sign in to Google as the test mailbox owner.
#   2. Open https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground
#   3. Authorize the scope: https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.readonly
#   4. Exchange the auth code and copy the "Access token" (starts with ya29.)
#
# Access tokens expire in ~1 hour, so refresh this right before a run.
GMAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN=ya29.your_google_oauth_access_token_here

# Optional: pin a specific existing Customer phone number for the Agent
# 500 Tk deposit instead of auto-discovering one from the Admin list.
# CUSTOMER_ACCOUNT=017XXXXXXXX
